<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
	<meta charset="UTF-8">
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
	<title>Three Card Variants</title>
	<style>
		* {
			box-sizing: border-box;
		}

		body {
			margin: 0;
			min-height: 100vh;
			padding: 40px 20px;
			background: #f1f5f9;
			font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
		}

		.card-container {
			display: flex;
			flex-wrap: wrap;
			justify-content: center;
			gap: 24px;
		}

		.card {
			width: 280px;
			padding: 24px;
		}

		.card h2 {
			margin-top: 0;
		}

		.card-rounded {
			border-radius: 8px;
			background: #ffffff;
			box-shadow: 0 4px 12px #0f172a1a;
		}

		.card-pill {
			border-radius: 28px;
			background: #dbeafe;
			border: 2px solid #60a5fa;
		}

		.card-accent {
			border-radius: 4px 32px 4px 32px;
			background: #dcfce7;
			border-left: 6px solid #16a34a;
		}
	</style>
</head>
<body>
	<main class="card-container">
		<article class="card card-rounded">
			<h2>Classic Card</h2>
			<p>A clean white background with gently rounded corners.</p>
		</article>

		<article class="card card-pill">
			<h2>Soft Blue Card</h2>
			<p>A pale blue background, blue border, and extra-rounded corners.</p>
		</article>

		<article class="card card-accent">
			<h2>Fresh Green Card</h2>
			<p>A light green background with alternating rounded corners and an accent edge.</p>
		</article>
	</main>
</body>
</html>
